  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>As we know, centre of mass is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>com</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>com</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#305;</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#567;</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#305;</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#567;</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>com</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>m</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#305;</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#567;</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#305;</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#567;</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>The magnitude of the position vector of the centre of mass is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math>.</p><p>It is similar to the magnitude of the option A.</p></blockquote>",
